      "body": "\n<div class=\"header-row\"><h2>Recommend only what the evidence supports</h2></div><div class=\"rule\"></div><div class=\"decision-chain\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Evidence and calculation lead to a stated model limitation and conditional recommendation\"><article><span>Evidence</span><strong>Trace the inputs</strong><small>Period, units, source</small></article><i>→</i><article><span>Calculation</span><strong>Reconcile claims</strong><small>Terminal value, equity bridge</small></article><i>→</i><article><span>Assumption</span><strong>Name the limit</strong><small>Peer fit, payout, capex returns</small></article><i>→</i><article><span>Recommendation</span><strong>State conditions</strong><small>Range or insufficient evidence</small></article></div><div class=\"deliverable\">Deliver: a four-sentence CFO brief—evidence → calculation → limitation → recommendation.</div><div class=\"choice-check\" data-interactive=\"decision\"><button type=\"button\" data-correct=\"false\">Use the highest model output</button><button type=\"button\" data-correct=\"false\">Use two model outputs as automatic bounds</button><button type=\"button\" data-correct=\"true\">Justify scenarios or request missing evidence</button><button class=\"check-button\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"check-choice\">Check reasoning</button><output aria-live=\"polite\">Choose the defensible next step.</output></div>\n    ",
      "note": "A strong response separates an assumption-defined sensitivity span from a researched valuation range. It may reasonably conclude insufficient evidence to price the IPO or recommend a buy/sell action. Students should cite a calculation, describe the model gap or terminal dependence, and name a specific next evidence request. For Apex, mention reconciled debt reduction, EPS dilution, and the unproven capex value assumption. Do not grade agreement with a preferred price; grade the chain from evidence to conclusion. Time: 4 minutes."
